  "description": "SEG BLM MOTOR\n\nThe iRS1 is equipped with the SEG BLM motor, an ultra-light 2.1 kg drive unit delivering up to 700 W of power and 80 Nm of torque for powerful, smooth and highly efficient assistance.\n\n810Wh | DUAL DISCHARGE TECHNOLOGY\n\nEvery model features a fully integrated 630 Wh battery housed inside the downtube, optimizing weight distribution for a more stable and natural ride.\n\nThe system is complemented by the XPro bottle-style battery.\n\nTotal Capacity:\n\n630 Wh + 180 Wh (XPro Dual Discharge) = 810 Wh\n\nEstimated Range:\n\n150 km + 40 km (XPro Dual Discharge) = 190 km\n\nINTEGRATED DISPLAY\n\nA fully integrated top tube display provides all essential ride information at a glance, including speed, assistance mode, battery range, power output, cadence, rider torque and ANT+ connectivity.\n\niBUTTONS\n\nThe iButtons allow instant assistance mode changes directly from the handlebar. Because they are wired directly to the battery, they provide immediate response with zero delay. A clean, reliable system that keeps your focus on the ride.\n\nAERO DESIGN & KAMM TAIL TUBE PROFILES\n\nThe new iRS1 delivers the perfect combination of power, range, lightweight construction and aerodynamic performance in a package designed for maximum efficiency and enhanced comfort over long distances.\n\nThe Kamm Tail tube profiles make the iRS1 a bike engineered for maximum aerodynamic efficiency. Their design optimizes airflow and reduces drag, making the most of every watt for consistent, efficient performance.\n\n*iRS1 Carbon 1.6 weight (size M): 12,9 Kg.\n\nAERO FORK | UP TO 32 mm TYRE CLEARANCE\n\nThe clearance between the fork and the front wheel has been carefully optimized to eliminate pressure zones, improving airflow while increasing vibration absorption from the road.\n\nThe frame also accommodates tyres up to 32 mm wide, enhancing both comfort and versatility across a wide range of riding conditions.\n\nFULLY INTERNAL CABLE ROUTING\n\nA clean frame with 100% internal cable routing through the ACR system.",
